## ANALYSIS METHOD

### 1. Build View Registry

Collect every `ir.ui.view` definition.

**Extract:**

```yaml
view_registry:
  <xmlid>:
    module: <module>
    model: <model>
    inherit_id: <parent_xmlid or null>
    arch_root: <list|form|kanban|etc>
    priority: <int>
    file: <path>
    line: <approx>
```

---

### 2. Build Parent View Map

For each inherited view:

- Resolve full inheritance chain
- Detect cycles
- Build merged arch (apply all xpaths in dependency order)

**Output:**

```yaml
inheritance_chains:
  <child_xmlid>:
    chain: [<root_view>, <parent1>, <parent2>, <child>]
    depth: <int>
    has_cycle: true|false
```

---

### 3. Parse XPath Expressions

For every:

```xml
<xpath expr="..." position="...">
```

**Determine:**

- **Selector stability:** forbidden / fragile / structural / overbroad / safe
- **Match risk:** zero / one / multiple / unknown
- **Anchor type:** positional / container / field-based / attribute-based

**Classification:**

```yaml
FORBIDDEN:    @string, text(), contains(text())
FRAGILE:      [1], [2], [last()], //group/group
STRUCTURAL:   //sheet/group, //notebook/page
OVERBROAD:    //group, //div, //button (without [@name])
SAFE:         //field[@name='x'], //page[@name='y']
```

---

### 4. Cross-reference Model Fields

**Extract fields from model definitions in Python:**

- Parse all `*.py` files for model classes (`_name`, `_inherit`)
- Build field index:

```yaml
model_fields:
  <model_name>:
    - field_a
    - field_b
    - ...
```

**Include inherited fields** (via `_inherit` and `_inherits`).

**Verify every view field reference exists:**

```xml
<field name="partner_id"/>  → check if 'partner_id' in model_fields[view.model]
```

---

### 5. Resolve External XMLIDs

**Verify:**

```xml
<field name="inherit_id" ref="module.xmlid"/>
<field name="view_id" ref="module.xmlid"/>
ref="module.xmlid"
```

**Check:**

- XMLID exists in repo
- If not in repo, mark `REVIEW_REQUIRED` (may be Odoo core)

**Build XMLID index:**

```yaml
xmlid_index:
  <module.xmlid>:
    type: <ir.ui.view|ir.actions.act_window|etc>
    file: <path>
    module: <module>
```

